# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout, everywhere.
#
# This matters more than usual here. src/main.ts starts with a shebang, and a
# shebang line ending in CR is not a valid interpreter path — a file edited on a
# Windows box with core.autocrlf=true would stop being executable on macOS and
# Linux. Pinning eol=lf keeps that from depending on each contributor's git
# configuration.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Source and docs are text, stated explicitly so nothing is guessed.
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
